12. TERM AND TERMINATION
================================================================================

12.1 Term. This Agreement takes effect upon Your first access to the Software
     and continues until terminated.

12.2 Termination for Breach. Licensor may terminate this Agreement immediately,
     without notice and without judicial process, upon any breach by You. Any
     breach of Section 4 or Section 9 is a material breach.

12.3 Termination for Convenience. Licensor may terminate any grant under
     Sections 3.2 or 3.3 at any time, for any reason or no reason, effective
     upon notice.

12.4 Automatic Termination. An Authorized User's rights terminate automatically
     upon the end of that person's membership, employment, or contractor
     relationship with Licensor, without any act by Licensor.

12.5 Effect. Upon termination, all rights granted cease immediately. You shall
     promptly cease all use of the Software, permanently delete or destroy all
     copies of the Software and Confidential Information in Your possession or
     control, including all copies on backup and cloud storage, and, upon
     request, certify that destruction in writing signed by an officer.

12.6 Survival. Sections 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 7, 9, 10, 12.5, 12.6, and 13 through 21
     survive termination.

12.7 Equitable Relief. You acknowledge that a breach of Section 4 or Section 9
     would cause irreparable harm for which monetary damages are an inadequate
     remedy, and that Licensor is entitled to seek injunctive and other
     equitable relief without the necessity of posting a bond or proving actual
     damages, in addition to all other remedies available at law or in equity.

